<resources>
    <!--
        The numerals for the 416x416 face.

        A bitmap font does not scale, and the layout around it does: every position
        in Layout.mc is a fraction of the screen, so on the smaller face the 454's
        atlas kept its 174 px line box while the room around it shrank by 38 px. It
        left one pixel between the digits and the second-time line, against eight on
        the 454. This is the same Oswald rasterised at 107 rather than 117 — 416/454
        of the size — which restores the proportions the 454 was tuned to.

        Regenerate with the command in tools/fontgen/README.md, substituting 107.
        Same Oswald, same SIL Open Font License — see resources/fonts/OFL.txt.
    -->
    <font id="TimeNumbers" filename="time_numbers.fnt" filter="0123456789:"/>
</resources>
